1
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,860
Somehow it'll work out.

2
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,940
Anyone without work, come to me.

3
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:04,520
I don't have any either, so don't worry.

4
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:11,560
Look, the steel is burning too.

5
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,260
Somehow, eventually, it'll work out.

6
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:23,520
You understand, right?
I understand, I understand.

7
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:27,460
Once you understand, shut up and follow me.

8
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:44,400
A life-size hina doll, you see...

9
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:45,740
Mm.

10
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:48,520
On March 3rd, Hinamatsuri day,

11
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,940
we'll make a life-size hina doll display

12
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:53,400
and exhibit it at the
nearby Katsushika Garden.

13
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:59,960
The event is set to be
broadcast nationwide on TV.

14
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:03,760
It should greatly improve
the Katsushika station's image.

15
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:10,000
Building sets to match human size will take quite a bit of work,
won't it?

16
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:14,340
Don't worry, Ohara. We've got someone
right here at our station, haven't we?

17
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:17,660
The man who's only useful
at times like this...

18
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,920
It's the hina dolls' birthday.

19
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,180
What did you say?

20
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:32,660
You want me to run the Hinamatsuri,
on March 3rd?

21
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,640
It's an order. You're good at this sort of thing,
aren't you?

22
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:42,120
There's TV coverage too, so do it properly.

23
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:46,920
Wait, Chief, not that.
Please, not March 3rd. Spare me.

24
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:52,240
This is an official order. And I'm telling you,
you're exempt from your other duties.

25
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:56,560
Then at least make the Hinamatsuri March 2nd.
The 4th is fine too.

26
00:02:56,560 --> 00:03:01,960
What nonsense. Hinamatsuri has been
set for March 3rd since ancient times.

27
00:03:02,420 --> 00:03:03,140
Chief...

28
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:07,760
If you fail and make a spectacle
of us across the whole country...

29
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,180
There'll be no bonus, understand?

30
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:25,500
Ryo-chan

31
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:26,600
Senpai

32
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,180
What's wrong, Ryo-san?

33
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:30,740
Do you really hate making
the hina dolls that much?

34
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,220
Terai-san, that's not it,

35
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,340
March 3rd, you know,

36
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:38,140
March 3rd?

37
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:41,400
Now that you mention it,
something was going on that day...

38
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,720
It's my birthday!

39
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,862
I see,

40
00:03:44,912 --> 00:03:47,980
Ryo-san, your birthday's March 3rd, right?

41
00:03:47,980 --> 00:03:51,700
You were born on Hinamatsuri, the girls' day

42
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:52,720
Annoying!

43
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:57,080
Speaking of which, I can't remember
ever having a decent birthday.

44
00:03:57,080 --> 00:04:00,160
For some reason,
I end up in terrible situations every year.

45
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:04,540
I got mistaken for a riot cop and
dragged through hellish training,

46
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:08,620
or somehow got taken all the way
to the Arctic to fight polar bears.

47
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:12,120
There was even the time
a tank fell from the sky!

48
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:18,860
March 3rd is my biggest unlucky day.

49
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,180
That's right.

50
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:22,960
Let's hope nothing happens this time.

51
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,640
I was planning to stay
home and sleep all day.

52
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:28,740
But an order from the chief...
we can't refuse, can we.

53
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,480
What was that?

54
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:41,340
It's Kankichi Ryotsu.

55
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:44,620
He's not up to some scheme again, is he?

56
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:47,520
No, it's on the Chief's orders.

57
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:50,700
Apparently we're making
life-size hina dolls.

58
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:53,360
Yeah, you lot are going to help too.

59
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:56,980
But you've got a bad jinx on March 3rd,
don't you?

60
00:04:56,980 --> 00:05:00,029
Yeah, so we finish it by March 2nd,

61
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:02,200
and I'm taking the day
off on the day itself.

62
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:05,140
What a waste, it's a chance to be on TV.

63
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:08,857
Too bad, I'll watch it at home on TV,
nice and relaxed.

64
00:05:08,907 --> 00:05:10,460
I value my life too, you know.

65
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:11,940
Ryotsu!

66
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:17,340
S-senpai!

67
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,400
Ryotsu!

68
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:24,580
Are you okay?

69
00:05:24,580 --> 00:05:31,440
Aaahh, it's nothing serious, thank goodness.
But there's no wind blowing either...

70
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:33,420
No way...

71
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:49,760
Senpai, what's going on here?
Hold on, I'm coming right now.

72
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,520
Gahh!

73
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:53,540
Yes!

74
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,160
Senpai!

75
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:02,840
What? It suddenly stopped.

76
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:06,340
The plug came out?

77
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:17,920
Yuzu!

78
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,280
Senpai!

79
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:21,960
You...

80
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,800
Are you trying to kill me?

81
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:36,780
Senpai.

82
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:38,120
I heard you got hurt.

83
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,200
Ryo-chan.

84
00:06:40,020 --> 00:06:40,880
It's a curse.

85
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,880
The misfortune that was
supposed to come on March 3rd

86
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,120
is coming early to me,

87
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,640
and it's raining down on me.

88
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:54,880
What else could it be, when I'm suffering
one disaster after another like this?

89
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,260
Indeed.

90
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:18,260
It's just an ordinary run of bad luck,
isn't it.

91
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,000
How pitiful.

92
00:07:22,380 --> 00:07:26,920
Why don't you just have an exorcism done?

93
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,780
Yes, let's get you an exorcism.

94
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:34,640
There's a spirit medium nearby
who's said to be really good.

95
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,400
Yeah, that's right.

96
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,960
An exorcism

97
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:47,700
Gaaah!

98
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:49,540
I see it.

99
00:07:49,540 --> 00:07:52,220
Did you find the cause of my misfortune?

100
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:56,240
That's the cause of your
misfortune on March 3rd.

101
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:59,000
It's all the curse of the hina dolls!

102
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:02,560
The curse of the hina dolls?!

103
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:04,080
You...

104
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:07,540
You once did something terrible to a hina doll,
didn't you?

105
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,400
Maybe... or maybe not.

106
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,340
Now that you mention it, I did.

107
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:17,300
It was back when I was
still in elementary school.

108
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:21,440
I barged into where the girls in my
class were holding a Hinamatsuri party,

109
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:24,780
and on the tiered platform,
I challenged the hina dolls to a fight.

110
00:08:25,860 --> 00:08:28,420
They once wiped out their opponents.

111
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,340
No doubt about it, then.

112
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,800
Just as I thought.

113
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:36,520
The hina dolls that were treated cruelly
harbor a grudge over it.

114
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:39,700
Every March 3rd, they take revenge on you.

115
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,880
This year,
you've forgotten the cruelty of the past,

116
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:45,917
and you're brazenly
trying to make hina dolls,

117
00:08:45,967 --> 00:08:47,520
so they're angry, aren't they?

118
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:48,780
You can tell that?

119
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,540
The dolls themselves told me so.

120
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,877
Hey, wait,

121
00:08:55,927 --> 00:08:58,820
do something about it!

122
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,580
Don't panic. We're professionals!

123
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,800
Leave it to me!

124
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,200
How did it go?

125
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:13,160
Did the exorcism go well?

126
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,320
It went perfectly.

127
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,760
I think so, anyway.

128
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:18,160
I can't tell yet.

129
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:21,240
Not until we actually
resume the work and see.

130
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,460
Let's get started.

131
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:30,520
First, should we lock this one up?

132
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:34,280
I found 500 yen!

133
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,320
Lucky you, Ryotsu.

134
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,740
Didn't the exorcism succeed?

135
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,720
No, I still can't say.

136
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:44,680
Something outrageous
might happen after this.

137
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:49,300
It's hollow inside.

138
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:54,380
It's a Hercules beetle!

139
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:55,500
Not bad.

140
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:57,680
Your luck's turned, Ryotsu!

141
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,580
No, not yet.

142
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:04,720
This came addressed to you, senior.

143
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,560
Could this be...?

144
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:10,120
A popular Tiger tank model.

145
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:13,520
The magazine survey I sent in
the other day came up a winner.

146
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:17,040
Your luck's really turned, senior.

147
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:21,200
Maybe the exorcism actually worked?

148
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,980
Looks like it did.

149
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:24,160
That's great news.

150
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:26,380
Yes, yes!

151
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:29,860
Now I've said goodbye to
the March 3rd misfortune!

152
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:33,420
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

153
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:36,880
The reason I called you
here is none other than

154
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,720
this year's life-size hina doll display.

155
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:43,280
I want you two to play the
Emperor and Empress dolls.

156
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,300
You want us to do it?

157
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:48,360
You two represent our station.

158
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,060
I'd really like to ask you.

159
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,980
I don't mind, but

160
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:53,260
Me too.

161
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:54,680
I see.

162
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,840
Then let's try on the costumes right away.

163
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,380
Wait, please.

164
00:10:57,980 --> 00:10:59,320
What is it, Reikon-kun?

165
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,700
I have a proposal, actually.

166
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:02,940
A proposal?

167
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:10,160
I'm sure it was around here...

168
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,040
Found it, found it.

169
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,840
After all,
we have to use real sake for the omiki.

170
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,300
What?

171
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,580
Ryotsu as the Emperor doll?

172
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:22,920
Yes, since he's the biggest
contributor to this hina festival.

173
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:26,520
But having him play the Emperor...

174
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,580
Will the public accept it?

175
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,640
It's also Senpai's birthday.

176
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:35,580
So if we make it a
birthday present for Senpai,

177
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:37,940
yes, everyone will agree.

178
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,560
I'd like to ask as well.

179
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:41,280
Please, Chief.

180
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,280
Understood.

181
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:47,120
If you're both that insistent,
then let's do it.

182
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:47,940
Thank you very much.

183
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:50,240
Ryo-chan will be so happy.

184
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:52,880
Me, as the Emperor doll?

185
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,200
Not bad.

186
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:04,040
Right, let's keep this
a secret from Ryo-chan.

187
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:04,680
Yes, that's right.

188
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,440
Let's announce it on
the day and surprise him.

189
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:12,080
Our luck turned the moment
we had the exorcism done!

190
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:28,800
Is the hina platform finished yet?

191
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:35,760
Right? Everyone has some redeeming quality.
Why don't you just give him an honest compliment?

192
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:42,920
Ryotsu's been oddly enthusiastic since partway through, hasn't he? Maybe something good happened to him.
Yes, I suppose so.

193
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:48,400
I wonder how the costumes are coming along.
I hear the women are making them.

194
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:51,800
Come over so I can take your measurements.

195
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:57,480
So the Emperor costume is finally happening.
Yeah, yeah.

196
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:00,360
What's wrong with Ryotsu?

197
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,500
What?!

198
00:13:02,380 --> 00:13:03,900
What do you mean by that?

199
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:07,440
Well, the TV station
told us this themselves.

200
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:11,420
They asked us to have women play
the hina dolls as much as possible.

201
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:13,780
The Five Musicians are men!

202
00:13:13,780 --> 00:13:15,240
They want women for them.

203
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:17,600
And the Minister of the Right
and the Minister of the Left?

204
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,640
They want women for those too.

205
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:23,440
So basically,
they're requesting that everyone be a woman.

206
00:13:24,660 --> 00:13:25,340
What's that supposed to mean?

207
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:29,920
What's going on? It was decided that
I would play the Emperor, though.

208
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:32,580
Then why did you call us here?

209
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:33,600
Exactly!

210
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:39,140
It's pitiful that you never appear on TV,
so I called you here to get you on it.

211
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:41,080
How?

212
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,080
This is it?

213
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,680
We'll have to paint their
faces in three colors, too.

214
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,260
Peach blossoms.

215
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:51,960
For generations.

216
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:53,780
What is this?

217
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:56,240
You want me to show myself
like this to all of Japan?

218
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,100
That's too much.

219
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:00,340
Ugh, you're so annoying.

220
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:01,520
Fine, I get it.

221
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,160
Well, then.

222
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,960
I'll make you a goshoguruma.

223
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,280
It hasn't changed at all, has it?

224
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,520
Well, then...

225
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,980
If it's the goldfish club,
you can't complain, right?

226
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,780
That's not the point.

227
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,280
This is ridiculous.

228
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:14,820
I'm not putting up with this.

229
00:14:14,820 --> 00:14:16,260
I'm going home.

230
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:17,820
Looks like I'm in for it.

231
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:22,580
What's that?
I was going to get you on TV, after all.

232
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:25,600
Fine, we'll handle the rest ourselves.

233
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:29,260
There's one thing I want to confirm.

234
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:29,940
What?

235
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:32,780
The Emperor doll is
supposed to be a man, right?

236
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:34,300
You know?

237
00:14:34,860 --> 00:14:35,800
Just as I thought.

238
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:39,240
The Emperor role was already
decided in advance, though.

239
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:42,560
That's right,
it was supposed to be mine, wasn't it?

240
00:14:43,180 --> 00:14:45,280
That's all I wanted to confirm.

241
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:46,680
Later.

242
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,740
What's wrong?

243
00:15:03,220 --> 00:15:06,720
If I do say so myself,
this hina display is truly magnificent.

244
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:10,400
Thanks, Ryo-chan,
for making such a wonderful hina display.

245
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:14,200
It's nothing. As a Katsushika product,
it's only natural that I did it.

246
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,960
The rehearsal will begin in ten minutes.

247
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:20,300
I repeat, the rehearsal is in ten minutes.

248
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:22,560
Well, in the meantime,

249
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:28,420
If I end up needing the bathroom while I'm up top,
that would be a real problem, wouldn't it?

250
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:33,720
What's with you lot?

251
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,940
You're pathetic, Ryotsu!

252
00:15:35,940 --> 00:15:38,880
After all that talk about the
men's side getting all the attention,

253
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:40,880
you're going to help those women?

254
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:43,620
That's not like you, senior.

255
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,780
Well, yeah, that makes sense.

256
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:48,280
What do you think you're doing?

257
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:51,120
If this is serious, we won't let it slide.

258
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,000
Is that all?

259
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,120
What do you mean, "is that all"?

260
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,980
We're angry, you know.

261
00:15:57,980 --> 00:15:58,980
You traitor.

262
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:00,820
Don't get the wrong idea.

263
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:04,100
I'm angry about how they've treated us too.

264
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,860
But think about it.

265
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:08,740
No matter how much the laws
and systems are revised,

266
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:10,820
Japan is still a male-dominated society.

267
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:13,780
The opportunities for women
to excel are still limited.

268
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:19,660
A day when women can take
the lead in a Japan like this.

269
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:21,600
That's what Hina Matsuri is.

270
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:24,600
And it's not as if we're
doing anything grand.

271
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:28,500
We just set out the hina dolls and
enjoy some hina-arare and amazake.

272
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:33,920
I figured we could save face
for them just for that one day.

273
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:38,280
Ryotsu,
I didn't think you'd considered it that far.

274
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:41,300
It's only natural for a man to do.

275
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:43,120
Rehearsal in five minutes.

276
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:48,860
We don't have time for this!
Isn't the Emperor here?

277
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:56,420
Sorry I'm late, Emperor, I'll change right now.
What is this? What's going on?

278
00:16:57,100 --> 00:17:04,980
Why? Because it's only natural for Nakagawa to play the Emperor.
He's the one most suited to the Emperor role at the Katsushika station.

279
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:09,540
I was supposed to be the Emperor,
you know! What?

280
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:13,780
Don't make jokes with that face of yours.

281
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:16,780
If I had to let you play the Emperor doll,

282
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:18,620
I'd rather put a pig there instead.

283
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:19,100
Hey,

284
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:21,520
no way.

285
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,460
All three of you,
please take your seats on the patient side.

286
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:26,240
Yes.

287
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,500
See, you've been tricked.

288
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:32,200
Because I thought I was the Emperor doll,

289
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,620
and I've held out this long.

290
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:37,620
I'm going to go astray.

291
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,480
Ryo-chan, where do you think you're going?

292
00:17:42,260 --> 00:17:45,240
Aren't you going back to the station?
The real thing is tomorrow.

293
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:48,300
Right, you'll be surprised
on the day for sure.

294
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:50,230
Yeah, well, senpai,

295
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:54,240
you surely didn't think you'd be
playing the Emperor doll yourself.

296
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:54,720
Hehehe.

297
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,020
Uwaaah, go!

298
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:04,180
What are you lot doing here?!

299
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:05,460
What do you mean, what?

300
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:08,880
We thought we'd add a special
touch to tomorrow's Hina Festival.

301
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:10,860
What are you making with those flowers?

302
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:13,620
Don't make anything!

303
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:14,760
Eeehhh?!

304
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:17,360
You lot, after

305
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,760
being worked to the bone
building the hina display,

306
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,480
after being treated like fools like that!

307
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:21,660
Aren't you angry?!

308
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:24,300
Earlier, you said

309
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:26,300
tomorrow is the Girls' Festival,

310
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,780
so we should let them save face.

311
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,900
That was just a general point!

312
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,020
Just look at the women in my house!

313
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:34,980
They already swagger around
like they own the place.

314
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,960
We men already feel out of place.

315
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:40,840
Why would we need to?

316
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,360
Now that you mention it,

317
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:43,880
just because it's Hina Festival,

318
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:46,560
if we pamper them,
they'll only get more cocky.

319
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:48,900
That's exactly why, on Hina Festival,

320
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:51,000
we must draw a firm line.

321
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,060
Do you have a plan?

322
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,600
I'm serious, I have a plan.

323
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:07,720
What?!

324
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,580
Seriously, Ryotsu Kankichi

325
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:11,480
is really playing the Emperor doll?

326
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:14,260
It's the senior's birthday today, after all.

327
00:19:14,260 --> 00:19:17,020
Plus, he's the biggest
contributor this time, right?

328
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:18,880
It's also meant as a thank-you.

329
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,300
Haven't we told Komachi-san
and the others yet?

330
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:22,580
Shoot.

331
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:24,140
What's wrong?

332
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:25,760
It's nothing.

333
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:28,300
I just noticed he still hasn't shown up.

334
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:31,460
Terai-san's out looking for him now.

335
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:35,780
The broadcast's about to start.

336
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:37,640
Are you all ready over there?

337
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:49,640
Listen up, everyone.

338
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:52,500
Women these days are getting
way too full of themselves.

339
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,380
Men getting weaker is part of the reason.

340
00:19:55,380 --> 00:19:58,840
We need to show our men's
strength once and for all.

341
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:02,300
So all of us men, the women's festival

342
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,340
we're going to wreck the Hina Festival.

343
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:09,240
Alright, I'm the vanguard captain,
I'll go declare it to the teacher.

344
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,320
You lot wait here, got it?

345
00:20:12,120 --> 00:20:12,480
Alright.

346
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:17,360
He doesn't seem to be inside the box.

347
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,360
We searched every nook and cranny,

348
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:22,200
Where could he have gone, senpai?

349
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,340
What are we going to do?

350
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:25,700
The broadcast is about
to start any minute now.

351
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:30,180
Like at the rehearsal, Nakagawa-san should

352
00:20:30,180 --> 00:20:31,660
Ryo-chan is here!

353
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:33,580
Senpai!

354
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:36,820
Hey, you guys!

355
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:38,740
Ryo-chan, we've been looking for you!

356
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,060
Senpai

357
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:46,560
Happy birthday!

358
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:48,360
T-this is...

359
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:50,960
Today is your birthday, Senpai.

360
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:53,980
We've all been preparing to celebrate you.

361
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:56,020
So that's what this was.

362
00:20:56,660 --> 00:21:00,360
And this is a birthday
present from everyone.

363
00:21:01,340 --> 00:21:03,000
It's the Emperor doll costume.

364
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:05,460
It's made to your exact size.

365
00:21:05,460 --> 00:21:07,880
I'm going to play the Emperor doll?

366
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:10,000
Sorry for keeping it a secret until now.

367
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,260
We wanted to surprise you a little.

368
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:13,780
You guys...

369
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:17,900
Thank you.
I've never been this moved before.

370
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,720
It's ten minutes until the broadcast!

371
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,160
Come on, hurry and change.

372
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:26,020
You're the star of the day, after all.

373
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:29,800
Why is Ryotsu taking so long to come back?

374
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,440
What is he doing?

375
00:21:41,340 --> 00:21:42,220
What's wrong?

376
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:45,900
Look, Ryotsu's gone and
become the Emperor doll!

377
00:21:45,900 --> 00:21:46,300
What?

378
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:46,740
What!?

379
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:49,680
Ryotsu, you betrayed us!

380
00:21:49,820 --> 00:21:52,300
If that's how it is, we don't need him!

381
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:57,260
Yeah, we'll bury the Hina Festival
along with that traitor Ryotsu!

382
00:21:57,900 --> 00:21:58,900
Eeeeeeh!

383
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:00,640
Ryo-chan, it suits you!

384
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,560
Really? Do you think so?

385
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:05,680
We're going live!

386
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:09,000
3... 2...

387
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:15,580
Here at Katsushika Garden, the officers of Katsushika
Station will show you life-sized hina dolls.

388
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:22,240
To pray for the children's traffic safety, the costumes
and hina musicians are all handmade by the officers.

389
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,040
Wow, magnificent!

390
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:25,580
Though I'm worried that Ryotsu is here...

391
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:29,680
Of course, both Odairi-sama and the
hina dolls are from Katsushika Station's

392
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:31,840
That is...

393
00:22:34,940 --> 00:22:38,340
Doki doki doki!
I'll reel in the male doll, too!

394
00:22:39,280 --> 00:23:05,480
Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!

395
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:08,100
To the men's festival grounds!

396
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,600
What is this mess?

397
00:23:13,620 --> 00:23:14,340
The head...

398
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:15,860
Chief...

399
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:21,680
Too late, then?

400
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,820
You...

401
00:23:22,820 --> 00:23:24,600
I saw it on TV and came flying over.

402
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:28,300
The curse on the hina dolls
attached to that man wasn't just one.

403
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:29,480
What do you mean?

404
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,520
The hina dolls he messed with

405
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:39,100
are possessed by the spirits
of countless hina dolls.

406
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:43,260
Sealing that many spirits
completely is impossible.

407
00:23:43,260 --> 00:23:46,400
So, senpai, from now on, every year...

408
00:23:47,540 --> 00:23:48,980
Adieu!

409
00:23:51,460 --> 00:23:54,360
I hate March 3rd!

